323
00:27:02,254 --> 00:27:03,552
I looked all around his off...

324
00:27:03,722 --> 00:27:05,762
I looked all around his
office for another new book.

325
00:27:05,891 --> 00:27:07,985
I couldn't find any, so I
went to the bookstore.

326
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,628
Do you know what
