327
00:27:09,795 --> 00:27:11,388
No.

328
00:27:13,198 --> 00:27:15,531
It was the biography
of Rodney Fisk

329
00:27:15,701 --> 00:27:19,160
the guy that Ruth Emerson went
down in the plane crash in Georgia.

330
00:27:19,338 --> 00:27:20,601
Ah.

331
00:27:20,772 --> 00:27:23,241
- And it wasn't in his office?
- No. It was nowhere.

332
00:27:23,408 --> 00:27:24,467
Are you sure?

333
00:27:24,643 --> 00:27:26,509
Yes. I looked everywhere.

334
00:27:26,678 --> 00:27:30,479
- Get me a copy of both books.
- Guess who went book shopping.

335
00:27:30,649 --> 00:27:34,950
Uh, Ruth, could I
