Tom Petri bought a copy
of this book the day he died.

338
00:27:53,672 --> 00:27:55,664
- Rodney Fisk's biography?
- Yeah.

339
00:27:55,841 --> 00:27:59,278
And he had a map to Pat
Preston's house in his wallet.

340
