Yes, get that bell here.

435
00:35:19,684 --> 00:35:20,844
She didn't know I was coming.

436
00:35:20,986 --> 00:35:23,854
I thought the three of us
should have a little talk.

437
00:35:24,022 --> 00:35:25,320
About what?

438
00:35:26,858 --> 00:35:32,297
About the, uh, fast one the
two of you are trying to pull.

439
00:35:33,298 --> 00:35:34,527
What is that supposed to mean?

440
00:35:34,699 --> 00:35:37,635
Well, I mentioned to
Pat about the boll weevils,

441
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:43,742
