have thought I meant 1936,

442
00:35:43,908 --> 00:35:45,809
which would have meant
there was no cotton crop,

443
00:35:45,977 --> 00:35:47,673
and that means
that there's no way

444
00:35:47,846 --> 00:35:50,145
she could have been out
in that field picking cotton.

445
00:35:50,315 --> 00:35:53,308
Well, that's no big deal.

446
00:35:53,485 --> 00:35:56,717
I heard you mention boll weevils
and I thought I'd made a mistake.

447
00:35:56,888 --> 00:36:00,586
She was just afraid maybe this
was all some kind of fantasy, Ben.

448
00:36:00,759 --> 00:36:04,025
And with the tail section
