449
00:36:04,195 --> 00:36:08,724
and now with this
new engine part,

450
00:36:09,567 --> 00:36:13,436
- your story would have been true.
- Well, that's right.

451
00:36:15,774 --> 00:36:20,872
Ruth told you that you
would not remember anything

452
00:36:21,046 --> 00:36:23,743
when you came out of hypnosis.

453
00:36:24,315 --> 00:36:29,583
Ruth told me that you had never
mentioned that engine part before.

454
00:36:29,754 --> 00:36:31,586
Well, I spoke to
her on the phone.

455
00:36:31,756 --> 00:36:34,316
You called her
answering machine.

456
00:36:34,959 --> 00:36:37,428
And that means the only
way you could have known

457
00:36:37,595 --> 00:36:39,587
