458
00:36:40,398 --> 00:36:43,163
was if you were
not under hypnosis.

459
00:36:43,334 --> 00:36:45,599
That means this
whole thing is a fraud.

460
00:36:45,770 --> 00:36:50,572
Tom Petri had a copy of that
agriculture book on his desk.

461
00:36:50,742 --> 00:36:52,836
He knew about the boll weevils.

462
00:36:53,411 --> 00:36:55,277
I think he was gonna expose you.

463
00:36:56,748 --> 00:36:58,182
- That's not true.
- Yes, it is.

464
00:36:58,349 --> 00:37:02,081
- Ruth, I...
