- Well, I don't know.

477
00:37:50,735 --> 00:37:55,196
But we were at the Athens motel.
You can call them. We were there.

478
00:38:10,155 --> 00:38:14,490
- Didn't find anything else?
- No.

479
00:38:14,659 --> 00:38:16,719
I guess you didn't
know where to look.

480
00:38:16,895 --> 00:38:21,424
- Oh, and you do?
- No.

481
00:38:24,169 --> 00:38:26,638
Hey, do you really think
Wally McDaniels did it?

482
00:38:26,805 --> 00:38:28,364
No.

483
00:38:28,540 --> 00:38:32,477
Well, who do you think did it?

484
00:38:32,644 --> 00:38:35,842
You wouldn't believe
me if I told you.

485
00:38:47,659 --> 00:38:50,891
- That's odd.
- It is?

486
00:38:54,132 --> 00:38:56,533
This court is now in session.

487
