- Uh, no.

525
00:41:49,407 --> 00:41:51,672
But you did go over
there, didn't you?

526
00:41:53,444 --> 00:41:59,008
He shouldn't have made
her cry. He called her names.

527
00:42:01,085 --> 00:42:04,749
Since the day he came by the church,
Miss Emerson was never the same.

528
00:42:04,922 --> 00:42:06,823
I could see it.

529
00:42:06,991 --> 00:42:10,052
We were very close.
Did I tell you that?

530
00:42:18,036 --> 00:42:19,595
Now, Mickey,

531
00:42:20,705 --> 00:42:26,941
this is a color photograph police
