00:43:28,573 --> 00:43:30,565
at St. John's
Hospital, weren't you?

546
00:43:31,843 --> 00:43:35,473
I... I needed a tetanus shot.

547
00:43:36,380 --> 00:43:40,044
You showed him
the gash in your arm

548
00:43:40,218 --> 00:43:45,885
and he saw the green ink on
your sleeve and on your skin.

549
00:43:48,960 --> 00:43:52,260
You know, I was following you.

550
00:43:55,633 --> 00:43:57,898
I didn't mean to scare you.

551
00:43:58,069 --> 00:44:01,471
I was gonna tell you it wasn't
Mr. McDaniels that did it.

552
00:44:03,941 --> 00:44:06,740
I never meant to make
it look like it was him.

553
00:44:06,911 --> 00:44:09,380
I think he knows that.

554
00:44:10,815 --> 00:44:12,545
That man,

555
00:44:14,218 --> 00:44:16,346
he shouldn't have done that.

556
00:44:18,723 --> 00:44:20,214
That was wrong.

557
00:44:32,870 --> 00:44:34,463
I'm sorry.

